},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nWorks in 4.5 dev2, broken in dev3\nRegression from #105482\nCC @maxpiepenbrink \n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nI have a complex menu layout that involves a control used to highlight options. My code to set its position no longer works in dev3.\n\nCorrect behavior (dev2):\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/481672b1-b3ff-4021-b13e-28b2bfc81d6c\n\nBroken (dev3)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/259c4450-1eeb-4680-ab29-6907c8d59e7c\n\nThe code that moves the highlight rect looks more or less like this:\n```GDScript\nmenu_selector.custom_minimum_size.x = width\nmenu_selector.set_anchors_and_offsets_preset(Control.PRESET_CENTER)\nmenu_selector.global_position.y = option.global_position.y - (menu_selector.size.y - option.size.y) * 0.5 + (4 if main_menu else 0)\n```\nI added a print for the values in the last line. The right side of the equation is the same between versions, but the final global value is incorrect. Important bit seems to be that the highlight rect is set to centered anchor preset _in the editor_. With top-left preset it's not working correctly in both engine versions (even though I force the preset in code).\n\nbtw, while it's a regression from #105482, that's a whole chain of PRs: #93908 -> #104451 -> #105482\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the MRP and press up/down to change options.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nStripped down version of the menu seen above.\n\n[Globalbug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19917486/Globalbug.zip)\n\nThe panel is moved in `update_selector()` method in Options script.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105771/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105771/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}